> Hi Fereshteh,
>
> What I have learned in the last day or so is the fact that I really do have no need to develop apps on Spark. I simply had not realized that I could develop locally (where I have R version 3 installed) and deploy to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> directly. Problem solved, and I'm the happy owner of a brand new app.
