> > The order issue is caused by having different "locale settings" on your local machine, and the shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> server. This setting affects the character sorting, which determines the output of levels.
> >
> > On Thursday, August 7, 2014 12:34:56 PM UTC-4, Homer White wrote:
> > > Oh, I forgot to mention that when I made a csv file with just one column (i.e., a single column with values in quotes, as opposed to the example above), then the levels were reported in the correct order.

