> How can I fix this?

Does this work as desired?  The vector that determines the sort order doesn't need to be the same as the vector that's returned.
selectInput( inputId='myId", label="whatever", choices=c(Names[ order(tolower <http://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/base/html/chartr.html>(Names)) ] )

>
> Why is this happening? I is some sort of encoding issue?

 What is the collate order returned by Sys.getlocale(category = "LC_ALL") <https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-patched/library/base/html/locales.html> in the two machines?

