Andres,

Well, I want to make the app work for you on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> :) And the first thing is to make it work for me locally. Since I have a clean environment, it would show what is missing from your application. The way I see your code, it is not sourcing any other script, so your data will never be loaded. I can load the data in my local environment and make it work for me, but your application should be all contained in order to work on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. So if you need to run an extra script, you have to source that within you Shiny code.

Hope this helps,
Fereshteh

